什么？其三维骨架是如何形成的？...', 'score': 0.7800536, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'qa_elasticsearch', 'metadata': {}, 'question': '地聚物材料的基本结构特性是什么？其三维骨架是如何形成的？', 'answer': 'A：地聚物是一种无定形至半结晶的聚合物，其核心结构由硅-氧-铝骨架构成。该三维骨架是通过硅酸盐和铝酸盐物种之间的聚缩合反应形成的。具体而言，它由SiO4和AlO4四面体通过氧桥连接组成，并含有K+、Na+或Ca2+等阳离子来平衡四配位铝（AlIV）所产生的负电荷，形成经验公式为Mn[(SiO2)z-AlO2]n·wH2O的结构。', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\\% {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\mathrm{{MgO}}$ composition range selected here was chosen to represent the bulk chemical composition range relevant to AAS-based cements.\n![0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg](images/0197456d-5913-7800-aa69-8d5449ef40b1_34_189_203_1268_880_0.jpg)', 'title': '', 'score': 0.05, 'source_type': 'document', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'ContentType.TEXT', 'extra': None, 'headings': [], 'strategy': 'semantic', 'page_number': [1], 'dual_vector_metadata': "{'general_text': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\\\mathrm{\\\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\\\mathrm{{mass}}\\\\% {\\\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2}$ , with the remaining chemical composition specified in terms of $\\\\mathrm{{CaO}},{\\\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\\\mathrm{O}}_{3}$ and $\\\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ only. The $\\\\mathrm{{CaO}}$ - ${\\\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - \\\\mathrm{{MgO}}$ composition range selected here was chosen to represent the bulk chemical composition range relevant to AAS-based cements.\\n![0197456